<!--
    Icon geometry.

    All paths are authored on a 24x24 grid and drawn as strokes, which keeps them crisp at
    every DPI and lets a single geometry be tinted per state. Geometries are frozen because
    they are shared by every instance of an icon and never change.

    Rendering helper: use the "Icon" style in Controls.Buttons.xaml, or a Path with
    Data="{StaticResource Icon.X}", Stretch="Uniform" and Width/Height 14-16.
-->
